      "beat": "setup",
      "padBefore": 0.2,
      "padAfter": 0.5,
      "say": [
        {
          "text": "他停了一下。"
        }
      ],
      "dur": 0.809,
      "audio": "out/voice/laoma-long-001/49-ma.wav"
    },
    {
      "who": "niu",
      "beat": "setup",
      "padBefore": 0.2,
      "padAfter": 0.5,
      "gain": 0.89,
      "say": [
        {
          "text": "你怎么一直不换个地方。"
        }
      ],
      "dur": 1.96,
      "audio": "out/voice/laoma-long-001/50-niu.wav"
    },
    {
      "who": "ma",
      "beat": "setup",
      "padBefore": 0.2,
      "padAfter": 0.4,
      "say": [
        {
          "text": "我这不是挺好的吗。"
        }
      ],
      "dur": 1.256,
      "audio": "out/voice/laoma-long-001/51-ma.wav"
    },
    {
      "who": "niu",
      "beat": "setup",
      "padBefore": 0.2,
      "padAfter": 0.6,
      "gain": 0.89,
      "say": [
        {
          "text": "你每天都说没意思。"
        }
      ],
      "dur": 1.733,
      "audio": "out/voice/laoma-long-001/52-niu.wav"
    },
    {
      "who": "ma",
      "beat": "setup",
      "padBefore": 0.2,
      "padAfter": 0.8,
      "say": [
        {
          "text": "是啊。但也没什么好换的，换哪儿不一样。"
        }
      ],
      "dur": 3.931,
      "audio": "out/voice/laoma-long-001/53-ma.wav"
    },
    {
      "who": "ma",
      "beat": "setup",
      "padBefore": 0.2,
      "padAfter": 1.5,
      "say": [
        {
          "text": "他没接话，把箱子换了只手。"
        }
      ],
      "dur": 2.284,
      "audio": "out/voice/laoma-long-001/54-ma.wav"
    },
    {
      "who": "ma",
      "beat": "setup",
      "padBefore": 0.2,
      "padAfter": 1,
      "say": [
        {
          "text": "然后我说了一句我自己也没想到会说的话。"
        }
      ],
      "dur": 2.54,
      "audio": "out/voice/laoma-long-001/55-ma.wav"
    },
    {
      "who": "ma",
      "beat": "setup",
      "padBefore": 0.2,
      "padAfter": 1,
      "say": [
        {
          "text": "其实我不是看破了。"
        }
      ],
      "dur": 1.078,
      "audio": "out/voice/laoma-long-001/56-ma.wav"
    },
    {
      "who": "ma",
      "beat": "setup",
      "padBefore": 0.2,
      "padAfter": 1,
      "say": [
        {
          "text": "我是不敢。"
        }
      ],
      "dur": 0.805,
      "audio": "out/voice/laoma-long-001/57-ma.wav"
    },
    {
      "who": "ma",
      "beat": "setup",
      "padBefore": 0.2,
      "padAfter": 1.2,
      "say": [
        {
          "text": "你干完一件事，你能知道自己干完了。我不干，我就永远不用知道自己行不行。看破多好听啊，说出去像是我看明白了，其实我就是没试。"
        }
      ],
      "dur": 12.228,
      "audio": "out/voice/laoma-long-001/58-ma.wav"
    },
    {
      "who": "ma",
      "beat": "setup",
      "padBefore": 0.2,
      "padAfter": 0.5,
      "say": [
        {
          "text": "我说完就有点后悔。"
        }
      ],
      "dur": 1.03,
      "audio": "out/voice/laoma-long-001/59-ma.wav"
    },
    {
      "who": "ma",
      "beat": "setup",
      "padBefore": 0.2,
      "padAfter": 1,
      "say": [
        {
          "text": "老牛看了我一会儿。他没说\"你别这么想\"，也没说\"其实你挺好的\"。"
        }
      ],
      "dur": 4.909,
      "audio": "out/voice/laoma-long-001/60-ma.wav"
    },
    {
      "who": "niu",
      "beat": "setup",
      "padBefore": 0.2,
      "padAfter": 1.2,
      "gain": 0.89,
      "say": [
        {
          "text": "那你现在知道了。"
        }
      ],
      "dur": 1.482,
      "audio": "out/voice/laoma-long-001/61-niu.wav"
    },
    {
      "who": "ma",
      "beat": "setup",
      "padBefore": 0.2,
      "padAfter": 0.4,
      "say": [
        {
          "text": "他走了，往地铁站的方向。走了几步他停住，把手里那个鱼缸放地上，回头冲我招手，让我过去。"
        }
      ],
      "dur": 8.427,
      "audio": "out/voice/laoma-long-001/62-ma.wav"
    },
    {
      "who": "ma",
      "beat": "setup",
      "padBefore": 0.2,
      "padAfter": 0.5,
      "say": [
        {
          "text": "我过去。"
        }
      ],
      "dur": 0.581,
      "audio": "out/voice/laoma-long-001/63-ma.wav"
    },
    {
      "who": "niu",
      "beat": "setup",
      "padBefore": 0.2,
      "padAfter": 0.5,
      "gain": 0.89,
      "say": [
        {
          "text": "这个你拿着吧。我路上不好带。"
        }
      ],
      "dur": 3.367,
      "audio": "out/voice/laoma-long-001/64-niu.wav"
    },
    {
      "who": "ma",
      "beat": "setup",
      "padBefore": 0.2,
      "padAfter": 0.4,
      "say": [
        {
          "text": "我养不活啊。"
        }
      ],
      "dur": 0.934,
      "audio": "out/voice/laoma-long-001/65-ma.wav"
    },
    {
      "who": "niu",
      "beat": "setup",
      "padBefore": 0.2,
      "padAfter": 1,
      "gain": 0.89,
      "say": [
        {
          "text": "能。就是每天换点水。"
        }
      ],
      "dur": 2.575,
      "audio": "out/voice/laoma-long-001/66-niu.wav"
    },
    {
      "who": "ma",
      "beat": "setup",
      "padBefore": 0.2,
      "padAfter": 1.2,
      "say": [
        {
          "text": "说完他就走了。这次没回头。"
        }
      ],
      "dur": 2.614,
      "audio": "out/voice/laoma-long-001/67-ma.wav"
    },
    {
      "who": "ma",
      "beat": "setup",
      "padBefore": 0.2,
      "padAfter": 0.3,
      "say": [
        {
          "text": "我把鱼缸拎回工位，放在窗台上。"
        }
      ],
      "dur": 2.718,
      "audio": "out/voice/laoma-long-001/68-ma.wav"
    },
    {
      "who": "ma",
      "beat": "setup",
      "padBefore": 0.2,
      "padAfter": 0.4,
      "say": [
        {
          "text": "那天晚上加班的人不多，屋里挺安静。我坐着看了那条鱼一会儿。"
        }
      ],
      "dur": 4.953,
      "audio": "out/voice/laoma-long-001/69-ma.wav"
    },
    {
      "who": "ma",
      "beat": "setup",
      "padBefore": 0.2,
      "padAfter": 0.8,
      "say": [
        {
          "text": "它不大，颜色也一般，游得很慢。四年了。"
        }
      ],
      "dur": 4.446,
      "audio": "out/voice/laoma-long-001/70-ma.wav"
    },
    {
      "who": "ma",
      "beat": "setup",
      "padBefore": 0.2,
      "padAfter": 0.5,
      "say": [
        {
          "text": "我想起下午那句\"那是他的事\"。他写十一页文档的时候，压根没指望有人看。他把鱼养四年的时候，也没指望这鱼能怎么样。"
        }
      ],
      "dur": 9.88,
      "audio": "out/voice/laoma-long-001/71-ma.wav"
    },
    {
      "who": "ma",
      "beat": "setup",
      "padBefore": 0.2,
      "padAfter": 0.8,
      "say": [
        {
          "text": "他不是为了结果干的。他就是干完。"
        }
      ],
      "dur": 2.981,
      "audio": "out/voice/laoma-long-001/72-ma.wav"
    },
    {
      "who": "ma",
      "beat": "setup",
      "padBefore": 0.2,
      "padAfter": 1.2,
      "say": [
        {
          "text": "我一直以为他傻。"
        }
      ],
      "dur": 1.048,
      "audio": "out/voice/laoma-long-001/73-ma.wav"
    },
    {
      "who": "ma",
      "beat": "setup",
      "padBefore": 0.2,
      "padAfter": 0.6,
      "say": [
        {
          "text": "十一点我走的时候，给鱼换了点水。换得不多，杯子接了半杯，倒进去，看了两分钟。"
        }
      ],
      "dur": 7.578,
      "audio": "out/voice/laoma-long-001/74-ma.wav"
    },
    {
      "who": "ma",
      "beat": "setup",
      "padBefore": 0.2,
      "padAfter": 0.8,
      "say": [
        {
          "text": "第二天我还是七点半到，坐我那个位置，活还是那些活。"
        }
      ],
      "dur": 4.771,
      "audio": "out/voice/laoma-long-001/75-ma.wav"
    },
    {
      "who": "ma",
      "beat": "setup",
      "padBefore": 0.2,
      "padAfter": 1,
      "say": [
        {
          "text": "我没变成老牛。"
        }
      ],
      "dur": 1.146,
      "audio": "out/voice/laoma-long-001/76-ma.wav"
    },
    {
      "who": "ma",
      "beat": "punch",
      "padBefore": 0.2,
      "padAfter": 1.5,
      "note": "黑场",
      "say": [
        {
          "text": "我就是每天换点水。"
        }
      ],
      "dur": 1.305,
      "audio": "out/voice/laoma-long-001/77-ma.wav"
    }
  ],
